{
  "_meta": {
    "detector": "CLD_o2_v07",
    "scope": "Full silicon tracker (Vertex + IT + OT)",
    "strategy": "hit_counts",
    "schema_aligned_with": "drawhits.py + hits2highLevelEstimations.py",
    "comments": [
      "Per-sub-detector assumptions for the bib-studies framework.",
      "Schema follows what drawhits.py and hits2highLevelEstimations.py expect:",
      "  - E_thr_MeV (top-level) for SimHit energy cut when --e_cut and not --digi",
      "  - digitized_hits.{collection,E_thr_MeV} for --digi --e_cut",
      "  - strategy / hit_size / multipliers for hits2highLevelEstimations.py",
      "",
      "Collection names below match TrackingDigiDetailed.py (key4hep):",
      "  outputDigiHits per sub-detector are VXDTrackerHits, VXDEndcapTrackerHits,",
      "  ITrackerHits, ITrackerEndcapHits, OTrackerHits, OTrackerEndcapHits.",
      "",
      "VTXdigitizerDetailed produces ONE TrackerHitPlane per cluster, carrying",
      "the cellID of (typically) the seed pixel - i.e. the cellID is at pixel",
      "granularity but represents the whole cluster. The hit_counts strategy is",
      "therefore the most natural fit:",
      "  bandwidth_layer = N_clusters * hit_size * rate * multipliers",
      "",
      "hit_size is in BITS per cluster. 32 is a placeholder - tune to your real",
      "digi format (header + col/row + ToT + timestamp). For InnerTrackerEndcap",
      "the MultiSegmentation gives ARCADIA 20x20 on layers +/-1 (unsigned 0)",
      "and ATLASPix3 50x300 on layers +/-2..+/-7 (unsigned 1..6), so the dict",
      "keys follow the signed-layer convention of CLD.py::_walk_endcap_subdet."
    ]
  },

  "VertexBarrel": {
    "hitsCollection": "VertexBarrelCollection",
    "digitized_hits": {
      "collection": "VXDTrackerHits",
      "E_thr_MeV": 0.0
    },
    "E_thr_MeV": 0.0,
    "strategy": "hit_counts",
    "hit_size": 32,
    "multipliers": { "safety": 3.0, "data_link_overhead": 1.2 }
  },

  "VertexEndcap": {
    "hitsCollection": "VertexEndcapCollection",
